        uncertainty   "+-0.17 J/(mol K) at 298 K, +-0.06 at 1000 K from the same propagation; above ~1500 K the harmonic model under-counts (anharmonicity, validated deficit up to -3 % at 1500 K and -7 % at 3000 K)";
        notes         "Cp(298.15) = 51.788, Cp(1500) = 94.357 J/(mol K) from the RRHO curve; fit error 1.5e-04 (<1000 K) and 2.9e-05 (>=1000 K), relative. Approximations: rigid rotor, harmonic oscillator, observed fundamentals used as harmonic; C2v, sigma 2";
